cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TopoPyScale 2 (TPS2): topographic downscaling of meteorological forcing"
message: >-
  If you use TPS2 in research, please cite it as below. TPS2 is developed by
  Joel Fiddes (Mountain Futures) and Simon Filhol (Météo-France); for research that builds substantially on it,
  please consider reaching out about co-authorship.
